  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Multipurpose Cadastre Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide technical assistance to the National Land Agency to advance the Social Planning of Rural Property in a targeted municipality, within the framework of the Multipurpose Cadastre Program. To this end, the Territorial Management Units will be strengthened through: (a) the development of institutional capacities for land regularization and (b) the strengthening of the legal security of rural dwellers with respect to the land on which they live and work, including through the promotion of greater knowledge of their rights. as well as the restrictions of the territory.</narrative>
  </description>
